  });
}
```

</details>

{{< /tab >}}
{{< /tabs >}}

## Inspect a path {#3-inspect-a-path}

Read metadata before deciding whether to download, move, or remove a path. A successful metadata read does not reserve the file: another process may change it afterward.

{{< tabs >}}
{{< tab name="TypeScript" >}}

```typescript
